WEBVTT

00:23:27.996 --> 00:23:31.038
It also showed us that when we're in
touch with our emotions at work

00:23:31.538 --> 00:23:34.121
and when we're thoughtful about
how we engage them,

00:23:34.538 --> 00:23:39.454
this provides data your team can use
to collectively problem solve.

00:23:42.371 --> 00:23:45.954
Thanks for listening. This show
is produced by Kim Netafim,

00:23:45.954 --> 00:23:50.746
Pietrzak Dandala is our mixer and
special thanks to Colin Helms,

00:23:50.954 --> 00:23:55.204
Michelle Quint, Angela Chang, Currahee,
Jim and Anna Feeling.

00:23:55.746 --> 00:23:57.329
I'll talk to you again next week.